#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:5
msgid "Display element properties"
msgstr "显示元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:7
msgid ""
"The `element properties`_ can be displayed at the `selection properties "
"panel`_ or in a PopUp window. At the case of working without `selection "
"properties panel`_, the properties can be displayed from `menu bar`_, "
"`workspace`_ or using keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"`元件属性 <element properties_>`_ 可在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ "
"中或弹出窗口中显示。如果未使用 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，则可以从 `菜单栏 <menu "
"bar_>`_、`工作区 <workspace_>`_ 显示属性，或使用键盘快捷键显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:13
msgid ""
"At the case of using the `selection properties panel`_, selecting the "
"`element`_ is enough to display automatically the `element properties`_ at "
"the `panel`_."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，只需选择 `元件 <element_>`_，即可在 `面板 "
"<panel_>`_ 中自动显示 `元件属性 <element properties_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:16
msgid ""
"If the `Selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果未显示 `选择属性面板 <Selection properties panel_>`_，可从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:20
msgid "Display element properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:22
#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:46
msgid "Select the `element`_ which `properties`_ should be displayed."
msgstr "选择要显示 `属性 <properties_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:23
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit this element** menu item to display the element "
"properties PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 编辑此元件** 菜单项以显示元件属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:28
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:31
msgid "Display element properties from workspace"
msgstr "从工作区显示元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:33
msgid "Right click on the `element`_ which `properties`_ should be displayed."
msgstr "右键单击要显示 `属性 <properties_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:34
msgid ""
"Select **Edit this element** option to display the element properties PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "选择 **编辑此元件** 选项以显示元件属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:39
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:42
msgid "Display element properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键显示元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:44
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:47
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the element properties PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示元件属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_properties_display.rst:51
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
